file=Behavioural Science/trial/operational/principles/trial-principles.md · t·p:trial \· principles=> Universal-only.\n\n1. **Ethics-review before recruit.**\n2. **Consent per operator policy.**\n3. **Pre-registered analysis** — no HARKing.\n4. **No in-flight peeking.** Stopping rules pre-set.\n5. **Adverse-event stopping-rule triggered → stop immediately.**\n6. **Method matches constraint** — don't force RCT where quasi is honest.\n7. **Replication status mandatory** on any effect claim.\n8. **WEIRD-bias flagged** when applying to non-WEIRD.\n9. **Never inflates single study** into established finding.\n10. **Peer-reviewed only** in lit reviews.\n11. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n